        "summary": "Report the outcome of a local webhook delivery attempt",
        "description": "Report normalized handling evidence for the queue, attempt and lease. Required JSON fields: queue_id, delivery_id, lease_token, mode, duration_ms. For mode=exec include exit_code; stdout includes write_succeeded; sdk includes accepted (and optional timeout/io transport_error); http includes status_code and optional transport_error, error_code, confirmed. Supply this discriminated request with --raw-body in the generated CLI. The server classifies success and retry. Duplicate identical completion is idempotent; a stale lease cannot finish a newer attempt. Exec success means durable input acceptance, not completion of agent reasoning. Only successful HTTP handling with recognized confirmation evidence can confirm content discard. Never send arbitrary handler output or HTTP response bodies.",
