        "tags": [
          "Account"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "Check what this credential can do",
        "description": "The grant of the credential that calls it: its permissions, mail scope, resources, template, credential kind and expiry. A credential may call it about itself without any permission, including a narrowed key without org:read, so a key can see its own permissions and mail scope. It answers nothing about any other credential. grant is null when the credential carries no grant.",
